  - m_Id: 3592653962399744
    m_Localized: Cheap, light, and easy to knock down. Perfect for starting out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592620110172160
    m_Localized: This is a sturdy one. However, knocking it over rewards you greatly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592571007455232
    m_Localized: Pretty drab weight and reward. That said, I wouldn't use this pin
      with the Giant Snowball unless you're into avalanches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592733134082048
    m_Localized: KABOOM! I'd cover my ears if I knocked this pin over!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592679656706048
    m_Localized: This pin slips all over the place, perfect for knocking over other
      pins!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592457660583936
    m_Localized: Knocking this pin over will take much power and a pretty hefty bowling
      ball, but with plenty compensation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592535162933248
    m_Localized: You're playing in the big leagues with these! Highly valuable and
      especially shiny!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3593288132775936
    m_Localized: Beware of this pin's infectious effects! [Crazy Lanes is not responsible
      for any liability or harm involving the use of radioactivity].
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3592709310435328
    m_Localized: All these other pins are quite pitiful, really. You wanna make some
      real money?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
